{"unit_id":"HONYUZHE__dsh-screen-reader#card-zh","repo":"HONYUZHE/dsh-screen-reader","commit":"0ea2f31c0029de7a173e954903eebbd80159304d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-screen-reader 为 DSH Web profile 提供 Android 屏幕读取和操作工具。它通过本机 DSHA 无障碍桥读取界面，默认返回精简树和屏幕变化，也可等待界面更新或附加截图。screen_read 支持文字筛选；screen_act 可点击、输入、按键、滑动或启动应用，并立即回读结果。适用于需要 DSH 代理观察和操作 Android 的场景。需要运行 DSHA 应用及无障碍服务；无需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:272-320","lib/index.js:416-498","lib/bridge.js:21-22"]}
{"unit_id":"HONYUZHE__dsh-screen-reader#card-en","repo":"HONYUZHE/dsh-screen-reader","commit":"0ea2f31c0029de7a173e954903eebbd80159304d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-screen-reader lets DSH agents inspect and operate Android screens through the DSHA accessibility bridge. screen_read shows a compact tree or changes; screen_act taps, types, presses keys, swipes, or launches apps, then reports results. Supports waiting and screenshots. Requires the DSHA app.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:272-320","lib/index.js:416-498","lib/bridge.js:21-22"]}
